{"id":"8805c772768bbd86","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-set12-sum-family-carrier.md","title":"ZFC Set12 Sum Family Carrier","display":"df-zfc-set12-sum-family-carrier — ZFC Set12 Sum Family Carrier","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set12-sum-family-carrier","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set12-sum-family-carrier"],"display":"df-zfc-set12-sum-family-carrier — ZFC Set12 Sum Family Carrier","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set12-sum-family-carrier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set12-sum-family-carrier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set12-sum-family-carrier — ZFC Set12 Sum Family Carrier"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"599d16bb1d9ed41c\" href=\"?note=599d16bb1d9ed41c\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,I,F,U\\in V\">\\(S,I,F,U\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> is the typed function predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle i,x\\rangle\">\\(\\langle i,x\\rangle\\)</span> is the ordered-pair code (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"599d16bb1d9ed41c\" href=\"?note=599d16bb1d9ed41c\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12SumFamilyCarrier}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet12SumFamilyCarrier}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}sum\\text{-}family\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet12SumFamilyCarrier}_S(S,I,F)\\leftrightarrow \\exists U\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(F,I,U)\\land S=\\{\\langle i,x\\rangle:i\\in I\\land x\\in F(i)\\}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}sum\\text{-}family\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet12SumFamilyCarrier}_S(S,I,F)\\leftrightarrow \\exists U\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(F,I,U)\\land S=\\{\\langle i,x\\rangle:i\\in I\\land x\\in F(i)\\}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The carrier is the tagged disjoint sum of the family <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\mapsto F(i)\">\\(i\\mapsto F(i)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]